{"sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","items":[{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k001","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"경쟁 저해제는 자유 효소의 기질 결합과 경쟁하여 겉보기 Km을 증가시키고 Vmax는 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k002","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"불경쟁 저해는 ES에만 결합하여 Km과 Vmax가 같은 비율로 감소한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k003","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"순수 비경쟁 저해는 E와 ES에 같은 친화도로 결합해 Vmax만 감소한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k004","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"혼합 저해는 둘에 다른 친화도로 결합하여 Vmax가 감소하며 Km은 증가 또는 감소할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k005","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"비가역적 저해는 활성 효소의 양을 줄인다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k006","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"다소단위 알로스테릭 효소는 조절 부위와 활성부위의 상호작용으로 협동성을 보일 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k007","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"대장균 ATCase는 카바모일인산과 아스파르트산을 이용하는 피리미딘 합성 효소로 CTP에 의해 억제되고 ATP에 의해 활성화된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k008","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"협동성 기질 포화 곡선은 흔히 S자형이며 단순 미카엘리스–멘텐 식에 잘 맞지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k009","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"되먹임 억제는 경로 최종 산물이 상류 효소를 억제한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k010","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"경쟁: Km↑ Vmax 동일.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k011","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"불경쟁: Km↓ Vmax↓, 이중역수선 평행.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k012","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"순수 비경쟁: Km 동일 Vmax↓.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k013","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"알로스테릭 조절과 비경쟁 저해는 동의어가 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--inhibition-k014","sectionId":"enzyme/inhibition","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"경쟁 저해다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}